From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 21:33:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ports/arkweb: <input type=file> pickers

Wire EmbedderControl::FilePicker to ACE's OnFileSelectorShow: hand the accept
filters + multiplicity to the ACE handler (which routes to the system file
picker by default), park the !Send FilePicker, and resolve it with the chosen
paths via file_picker_continue/file_picker_cancel (select+submit, else dismiss).

Add test_file_picker.py: tapping an <input type=file> reaches the control and
opens a picker, and `multiple` reaches the shim (asserted via a hilog marker,
since ACE's picker UI leaves no page-observable signal on the unhandled path).

Validation: Test by running uv run ports/arkweb/tools/test_file_picker.py on a device.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; implementation and on-device testing)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <jschwender@posteo.net>
